  ;; this is etzhayyim (עץ חיים) as a followable/listed entity in its OWN
  ;; registry, per the owner's question "etzhayyim.com 自体にも actor として
  ;; 登録されている?"). NOTE: `toDidDoc` (src/registry/actor-profiles.ts)
  ;; always derives the DID doc's `id` as `did:web:etzhayyim.com:actor:<handle>`
  ;; regardless of :actor/did — so this is a DISTINCT DID from the org's own
  ;; root identity document (did:web:etzhayyim.com, the live
  ;; 50-infra/etzhayyim-did-web/did.json), not a re-registration of it. Making
  ;; the bare root DID itself resolve a getProfile view would require changing
  ;; worker.ts's DID-resolution routing — deliberately NOT done here (owner
  ;; chose the low-risk path: a proper sub-actor representing the org, zero
  ;; changes to the live root DID resolution logic). ─────────────────────────
